---
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import PageFooter from '../components/PageFooter.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import GoogleAnalytics from '../components/GoogleAnalytics.astro';
import Fonts from '../components/Fonts.astro';
import SiteSchema from '../components/SiteSchema.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';

const breadcrumbItems = [
  { label: 'Privacy Policy' }
];

const lastUpdated = 'August 30, 2026';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <GoogleAnalytics />
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy - InsureEstimate</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Read InsureEstimate's Privacy Policy. Learn how we protect your information, enforce no data-selling policies, and maintain client-side calculator privacy.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://insureestimate.com/privacy-policy/" />
  <Fonts />
  <SiteSchema />
</head>
<body class="bg-canvas font-sans text-ink antialiased">
  <SiteHeader active="" />

  <main class="w-full pt-16">
    <div class="container-page pt-8">
      <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbItems} />

      <!-- HEADER CONTAINER -->
      <section class="mb-12 mt-8 border-b border-hairline pb-10">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <span class="eyebrow">Legal & Governance</span>
          <h1 class="title-page">
            Privacy Policy
          </h1>
          <p class="font-mono text-body-sm text-mute">
            Effective Date: {lastUpdated} | InsureEstimate Platform Transparency Standard
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- POLICY CONTENT BODY -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_240px] lg:gap-16">
      <div class="max-w-prose space-y-12 text-body-lg text-body [&_strong]:font-semibold [&_strong]:text-ink">
        
        <!-- SECTION 1: INTRODUCTION -->
        <section id="section-1" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold leading-8 tracking-[-0.9px] text-ink">
            1. Introduction & Commitment to Privacy
          </h2>
          <p>
            At <strong>InsureEstimate</strong> ("we," "our," or "us"), privacy is a cornerstone of our service design. We operate an independent actuarial estimation platform providing cost benchmarks for renters insurance across all 50 US states and business insurance across 35+ professional categories.
          </p>
          <p>
            Unlike traditional insurance lead-generation sites that capture personal identifiable information (PII) to sell to aggressive sales agents, InsureEstimate is engineered to minimize data collection. Our rate calculators run client-side in your browser, allowing you to estimate insurance costs without surrendering sensitive financial details, Social Security Numbers (SSNs), or contact information.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 2: INFORMATION WE COLLECT -->
        <section id="section-2" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-4 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold leading-8 tracking-[-0.9px] text-ink">
            2. Information We Collect
          </h2>
          <p>We strictly limit the information collected across our platform:</p>
          
          <div class="well space-y-5 p-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-body-lg font-semibold text-ink">A. Interactive Calculator Inputs (Non-Identifiable)</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-body-md text-body">
                When you input variables into our Renters Insurance Calculator (e.g., state selection, personal property valuation, deductible preference, liability limit) or Business Insurance Calculator (e.g., profession code, annual revenue tier, employee count, coverage type), these parameters are processed locally within your web browser. They are not tied to your identity.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-body-lg font-semibold text-ink">B. Voluntary Contact Submissions</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-body-md text-body">
                If you choose to submit inquiries through our Contact Us form, we collect the information you explicitly provide: your full name, email address, inquiry topic, and message content. This data is used solely to respond to your communication.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-body-lg font-semibold text-ink">C. Automated Technical Log Data</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-body-md text-body">
                Like standard web server infrastructure, our hosting environment logs standard technical metadata, including internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, device type, operating system, referring URLs, timestamp of access, and pages viewed. This technical data is aggregated for security monitoring and system optimization.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 3: WE DO NOT SELL DATA -->
        <section id="section-3" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-4 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-brand/30 bg-brand-soft p-6">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined shrink-0 text-[24px] text-brand-ink">verified</span>
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <h2 class="text-heading-md text-ink">
                3. Strict Policy: We Do Not Sell Your Data
              </h2>
              <p class="text-body-lg text-body">
                InsureEstimate does not sell, rent, license, or monetize your personal information to third-party insurance brokers, marketing agencies, or data brokers. You will never receive unsolicited phone calls, emails, or spam resulting from using our cost estimation tools.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 4: COOKIES & LOCAL STORAGE -->
        <section id="section-4" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-4 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold leading-8 tracking-[-0.9px] text-ink">
            4. Cookies & Local Storage Technologies
          </h2>
          <p>
            We use essential cookies and browser local storage to maintain session preferences (such as remembering your selected state or calculation inputs as you navigate between pages). We may also utilize privacy-preserving, anonymized web analytics to measure aggregate page traffic patterns.
          </p>
          <p>
            You can modify your browser settings to disable cookies or clear local storage at any time; however, doing so may reset your saved calculator state during browsing.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 5: DATA SECURITY & RETENTION -->
        <section id="section-5" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-4 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold leading-8 tracking-[-0.9px] text-ink">
            5. Data Security & Retention
          </h2>
          <p>
            We implement industry-standard administrative, physical, and technical safeguards to protect server communications via TLS/SSL encryption. Voluntary contact form communications are retained only as long as necessary to address your specific request or comply with legal obligations.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 6: USER PRIVACY RIGHTS -->
        <section id="section-6" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-4 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold leading-8 tracking-[-0.9px] text-ink">
            6. Your Privacy Rights (CCPA/CPRA & GDPR Compliance)
          </h2>
          <p>
            Depending on your jurisdiction (such as California under the CCPA/CPRA or Europe under GDPR), you possess specific privacy rights regarding your data:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 marker:text-faint">
            <li><strong>Right to Know & Access:</strong> You may request disclosure of any personal data we hold about you.</li>
            <li><strong>Right to Deletion:</strong> You may request the deletion of your submitted contact messages.</li>
            <li><strong>Right to Correction:</strong> You may request correction of inaccurate personal data.</li>
            <li><strong>Right to Non-Discrimination:</strong> We do not discriminate against users who exercise their legal privacy rights.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 7: CONTACT US REGARDING PRIVACY -->
        <section id="section-7" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-4 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold leading-8 tracking-[-0.9px] text-ink">
            7. Contact Information
          </h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions or privacy concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise your data rights, please contact our Data Compliance Team:
          </p>
          <div class="well space-y-1 p-6 text-body-md">
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">InsureEstimate Data Privacy Office</p>
            <p class="text-body">Email: <a href="mailto:hi.gyanaranjanpatra@gmail.com" class="link">hi.gyanaranjanpatra@gmail.com</a></p>
            <p class="text-body">Web Form: <a href="/contact" class="link">https://insureestimate.com/contact</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>

      <aside class="hidden lg:block">
        <nav class="sticky top-28 flex flex-col gap-3 border-l border-hairline pl-5 text-body-md" aria-label="On this page">
          <span class="text-label-sm text-ink">On this page</span>
          <a href="#section-1" class="link-quiet">1. Introduction &amp; Commitment to Privacy</a>
          <a href="#section-2" class="link-quiet">2. Information We Collect</a>
          <a href="#section-3" class="link-quiet">3. Strict Policy: We Do Not Sell Your Data</a>
          <a href="#section-4" class="link-quiet">4. Cookies &amp; Local Storage Technologies</a>
          <a href="#section-5" class="link-quiet">5. Data Security &amp; Retention</a>
          <a href="#section-6" class="link-quiet">6. Your Privacy Rights (CCPA/CPRA &amp; GDPR Compliance)</a>
          <a href="#section-7" class="link-quiet">7. Contact Information</a>
        </nav>
      </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <PageFooter />
</body>
</html>
